        "text": "The Utpala'di Group :— The drugs known as Utpala, Raktotpala, Kumuda Saugondhika, Kuvalaya, Pundarika and Madhuka constitute the group known as the Utpaladi Gana.\nlYIetrical Texts : — This group is possessed of the therapeutic virtue of allaying thirst and corrects the deranged Pittam and the vitiated blood.",
