        "text": "It assuages the burning sensation of the body and proves curative in cases of vomiting, in Hridroga (Angina pectoris in syncope, in ha3moptsis and in cases of poisoning as well. The lYIusta'di Group :— The group of drugs known as Mushtadi Gana is composed of Musta, Haridra, Daru-Haridra, Haritaki, Amlaki, Vibhitaka, Kushtha, Haimavati, Vacha, Patha, Katu-rohini, Sharngashta, Ativisha, Dravidi, Bhallataka and Chitraka.",
