        "text": "The A'mlakya'di Group :— The group known as the Amlakyadi Gana consists of Amlaki, Haritaki, Pippali and Chitraka. Metrical Text : — The present group of medici-nal drugs acts as a general febrifuge and may be used with advantage in fevers of whatsoever type. Moreover, it is an aphrodisiac and acts as a general tonic or resto-rative and appetiser, destroying the deranged Kapham and improving the eyesight.",
        "iast": "pippalīmaricaśṛṅgaverāṇi trikaṭukam"
