        "iast": "ādhmānaṁ gamane+aśaktirdaurbalyaṁ durbalāgnitā/ śophaḥ sadanamaṅgānāṁ saṅgo vātapurīṣayoḥ/ dāhastṛṣṇā ca sarveṣu jaṭhareṣu bhavanti hi"
