        "text": "It is attended with fever and a burning sensation, and is of rapid growth and suppuration. 6. The Kaphaja Type:— This abscess is shaped like an Indian saucer (s'arava) and seems cold to the touch. It assumes a light yellow colour and is character-ised by numbness, itching and little pain.",
