        "sanskrit": "अथातः शूकदोषनिदानꣳ व्याख्यास्यामः",
        "text": "Now we shall discourse on the Nidanam of the disease known as SukadOSha. i. Any of the eighteen different types of the disease may affect the genital (penis) of a man who foolishly resorts to the practice of getting it abnormally elongated and swollen by plastering it with Suka (a kind of irritating water insect) and not in the usual officinal way.",
