        "number": "76",
        "sanskrit": "ब्रह्मरुद्रेन्द्रवरुणैः सिꣳहाश्वगजगोवृषैः तार्क्ष्यहꣳससमानूकाः श्लेष्मप्रकृतयो नराः",
        "text": "He is vigorous and is simply irresistible in battle. He dreams in his sleep of such things as meteors, lightning-flashes, fire, Nageshvara, Palas'a or Karnikara plants. He is never overpowered with fear nor bends before a powerful antagonist ; he protects the suppliant and is very often afflicted with suppuration in the cavity of the mouth.",
