        "text": "V.\nbones belong to Nalaka class (long-bones, lit.— recd-likc or cylindrical). 21. Mcmorablc Verses : — As trees arc supported by the hard core inside their trunks, so the body is supported (and kept erect) by the firm bones (which are found in its inside). And since these bones form the pith (Sara) of the human organism, they are not des-troyed even after the destruction and falling off of the attached flesh, skin, etc. of the body.",
