        "text": "Another alternative is a pulverised compound consisting of the burnt ashes of the bones, nails, hair, skin, hoofs and horns of any quadruped, over a part of the body, previously anointed (rubbed)\nwith oil, which would lead to the appearance of hair in that region.",
