        "sanskrit": "यो+अल्पौषधकृतो योगो बहुग्रन्थभयान्मया/ द्रव्याणां तत्समानानां तत्रावापो न दुष्यति",
        "text": "The comparatively smaller number of drugs which I have mentioned (under the heads of Ropana, Sodhana, etc., in the present chapter) from fear of prolixity, may be increased in combination with other drugs or substances of similar virtue, (digestionary trans-formation and potency, etc.) without any apprehension t The six causes of an ulcer are Vayu, Pitta, Kapha, Sannipta, S'onita aud Agantu.",
