        "type": "verse",
        "number": "136",
        "sanskrit": "प्रसङ्गाभिहितो यो वा बहुदुर्लभभेषजः/ यथोपपत्ति तत्रापि कार्यमेव चिकित्सितम्",
        "text": "X The eight seats of an ulcer are Tvak, Mansa, S'ird, Snayu, Sandhi, Asthi, Koshiha and Marma. The five symptoms of an ulcer are dae to Vata, Pitta, Kapha, Sannipata and Agantu, The symptoms due to S'onita being identical with those due to Pitta, are not separately counted, II The sixty medicinal measures and remedies are those described before in the present chapter.\n264 THE SUSHRUTA SAMIIITA. [Chap.",
