        "number": "137",
        "sanskrit": "गोणोक्तमपि यद्द्रव्यं भवेद्व्याधावयौगिकम्/ तदुद्धरेद्यौगिकं तु प्रक्षिपेदप्यकीर्तितम्",
        "text": "I.\nof doing any mischief thereby. Recipes consisting of rare or a large number of drugs or ingredients, should be made up with as many of them as would be available in the absence of all of them, as mentioned in the present work, A drug belonging to any parti-cular Gana or group if separately described as non-efficacious to any specific disease, should be omitted whereas a drug not belonging to a group may be added to it if it is elsewhere laid down as positively beneficial thereto. 11 5-1 17.",
        "iast": "goṇoktamapi yaddravyaṃ bhavedvyādhāvayaugikam/ taduddharedyaugikaṃ tu prakṣipedapyakīrtitam"
