        "text": "Now we shall discourse on the medical treatment of recent or traumatic wounds or sores (Sadyovrana-Chikitsa). i, Metrical Texts; -The holy Dhanvantari, the foremost of the pious and the greatest of all discoursers, thus discoursed to his disciple Sus'ruta, the son of Vis'vdmitra.",
