        "text": "266 THK SUSHRUTA SAMIIITA. [Chap. II.",
        "iast": "śarāvanimnamadhyāśca yavamadhyāstathā+apare/ evaṃprakārākṛtayo bhavantyāgantavo vraṇāḥ"
