        "iast": "mahānti ca prāṇavatacchittvā dahet, nirgatāni cātyarthaṃ doṣapūrṇāni yantrādvinā svedābhyaṅgasnehāvagāhopanāhavisrāvaṇālepakṣārāgniśastrairupācaret; pravṛttaraktāni ca raktapittavidhānena, bhinnapurīṣāṇi cātīsāravidhānena, baddhavarcāṃsi snehapānavidhānenodāvartavidhānena vā; eṣa sarvasthānagatānāmarśasāṃ dahanakalpaḥ"
