        "text": "Now we shall discourse on the medical treatment of Fistuia-in-ano, etc., (Bhag'andara). r. The disease admits of being divided into five different groups, of which the two, known as S'ambukavarta and S'alyaja (traumatica, should be regarded as incurable, and th rest as extremely difficult to cure.",
