        "text": "Now vc shall discourse on the medical treatment of cutaneous affections in general (Kushtha). i. A cutaneous disease (Twag-dosha) originates through injudicious conduct of life such as partaking of large quantities of unwholesome food, or taking it before the previously eaten one is digested (i. e , eating too often), indulgence in incompatible articles of fare, voluntary suppression of the natural urgings-of the body, and improper application of medicated oil, clarified butter, or other lardacious articles.",
