        "text": "Regulation of diet and conduct : —\nThe old and matured grain of S'cili, Shashtika, barley, wheat, Koradusha S'ydnidka, Udddlaka, etc., boiled and taken along with the soup (Supa) or a decoction (Yusha)\n-.'.'1,4?\nof either Mtidga pulse or Adhaki pulse mixed with Nimha leaves and Arushkara are wholesome in a case of Kushtha.",
