        "sanskrit": "द्वे लोहरजसः प्रस्थे त्रिफलात्र्याढकं तथा/ त्रिद्रोणे+अपां पचेद्यावद्भागौ द्वावसनादपि",
        "text": "The white ashes of the said cobra mixed with one and a half time of its own weight of water should be filtered seven times in the manner of preparing an alkali. Mustard oil should be cooked with this alkaline water weighing four times as much.",
