        "text": "Cow's urine should be sprinkled over the diseased locality and all food (of the patient) should be given with the powders of Vidanga. 31-32. As an alternative, the affected parts should be rubbed with the oil of Karanja, mustard, S'igru or Kos'dfnra, or with an oil (any one of the preceding oils)\ncooked with (a decoction of) pungent, bitter and heat-producing substances.",
