        "text": "X The decoction should be prepared in the manrer of \" Shadanga-Ualpa.\"\nVajraka-Taila :— The roots of Sapta-pania, Karanja, Arka, Mdlati, Karavira, Snuhi, S'irisha, Chitraka and Asphotd as well as of Visha (aconite root), Ldngala, VajrakJiya (mica), sulphate of iron, Haritdla, Manah-s ild KaraHja-SQ.Q6.s, Trikatu, Triphald, the two kinds of Haridrd, white mustard-seeds, Vidanga and Prapunndda should be pasted together with the urine of a cow.",
