        "sanskrit": "यथा हन्ति प्रवृद्धत्वात् कुष्ठमातुरमोजसा/ तथा हन्त्युपयुक्तस्तु खदिरः कुष्ठमोजसा",
        "text": "IJ . The paring of the nails and shaving the hair off, light physical exercise, the use of wholesome food, regularity in using medicines, abstinence from wine, women and meat-diet arc the rules of conduct which should be strictly observed by a patient affected with Kushtha.",
