        "iast": "mahādhanamahitāhāramauṣadhadveṣiṇamīśvaraṃ vā pāṭhābhayācitrakapragāḍhamanalpamākṣikamanyatamamāsavaṃ pāyayet, aṅgāaraśūlyopadaṃśaṃ vā mādhvīkamabhīkṣṇaṃ, kṣaudrakapitthamaricānuviddhāni cāsmai pānabhojanānyupaharet, uṣṭrāśvatarakharapurīṣacūrṇāni cāsmai dadyādaśaneṣu; hiṅgusaindhavayuktairyūṣaiḥ sārṣapaiśca rāgairbhojayet; aviruddhāni cāsmai pānabhojanānyupaharedrasagandhavanti ca; pravṛddhamehāstu vyāyāmaniyuddhakrīḍāgajaturagarathapadāticaryāparikramaṇānyastropāstre vā severan"
