        "text": "Such a Pidaka should be remedied with the measures described in connection with Vranas, as soon as the process of suppuration would set in; whereas According to Dallana, the introduction of this medicated Ghrila into the text is an interpolation. Since Jejjata has not explained it in his commentary, Dallana does not explain it. Chakradatta, however, mentions this Ghrita in his compilation, though with some additions and alterations under the Ireatment of Prameha. — Ed.\n382 THE SUSHKUTA SAMllITA. [Chap.",
        "iast": "apakvānāṃ tu piḍakānāṃ śophavat pratīkāraḥ, pakvānāṃ vraṇavaditi; tailaṃ tu vraṇaropaṇamevādau kurvīta, āragvadhādikaṣāyamutsādanārthe, śālasārādikaṣāyaṃ pariṣecane, pippalyādikaṣāyaṃ pānabhojaneṣu, pāṭhācitrakaśārṅgeṣṭākṣudrābṛhatīsārivāsomavalkasaptaparṇāragvadhakuṭajamūlacūrṇāni madhumithāṇi praśnīyāt"
