        "text": "This is called the Navayasa Churna, which proves curative in abdominal obesity, improves the impaired digestion and acts as a prophylactic against haemor-rhoids, swelling, jaundice, Kushtha, indigestion, cough, asthma and Prameha, etc. 10. LohariShta :— A decoction of the drugs of the S'ald-sdrddi group should be made by boiling it down to a quarter part (of the original quantity of water).",
