        "text": "But Gayadasa explains that such a quantity of old and matured honey should be mixed with the decoction as will sweeten it ; the same quantity of old and matured Phanita treacle should be taken ; the powders of Pippalyadi group should be added to it till it gets a slight astringent (Katuka)\ntaste.",
