        "text": "In the case of a loDgitudilial 406 THE SUSHRtJTA SAMHITA. [Chap. XV.\npresentation (the child coming stretched cross-wise) like a belt and arrested in the passage, its lower extremities should be pushed upward with the hand and the child should be drawn out with its upper part (viz., the head, etc.), thus pointed downward, and brought straight into the passage of parturition.",
