        "text": "Treatment of Kaphaja Visarpa :—\nCases of the Kaphaja type of Visarpa readily yield to a proper application of a medicinal plaster (Pradeha)\ncomposed of Aj'a-gandhd, As'va-gandhd, Sarald Kdld, Ekaishikd ) and Aja-s'ringi pasted with the urine of a cow.",
