        "text": "A decoction of (the drugs of) the Vrihat-Pancha-mula group should be constantly used in washing the ulcer. Oil i duly cooked with the following drugs, viz , Himsrd, Haridrd, Katuka, Vald, GojiJivikd and Viha-xoois should be used for the purification, filling up and healing of the sores of the sinus. 9-1 1.",
