        "text": "After their bursting (and falling ofi), they should be treated as common ulcers (Vrana 16, The different kinds of Plug-Stick (Varti) described in the Dvi-Vraniya Chapter (Chikitsita — chap.-i.) may be similarly used with advantage in all cases of sinus.",
