        "text": "Now we shall discourse on the medical treatment of Glandular Swellings, etc. (Granthi), Scurvy (Apachi), Tumour, etc. (Arvucla) and Goitre (Gala-ganda). r General treatment of Granthi : ln the non-suppurated or acute (inflammatory) stage of Granthi, an experienced physician should prescribe the measures laid down in connection with ( in-flammatory) swellings (Sopha) in general. As bodily strength arrests the progress of the disease, the strength of the patient should hence be always carefully guarded against suffering any diminution in that respect.",
