        "text": "In the case of a Vataja Granthi, a potion of oil cooked with the decoction and paste (Kalka) of the Yayu-subduing drugs should be prescribed for the patient ; in the case of a Pittaja Granthi, clarified butter cooked with the decoction and Kalka of the Pitta-subduing drugs should be administered in the same manner ; while in the case of a Kaphaja Granthi, oil cooked with the decDCtion and Kalkx of the Kapha-subduing drugs should be taken by the patient.",
