        "text": "R) pasted together, should be applied vto the inflamed gland) in the Vaitaja type of Granthi. Different kinds of fomen-tation (Sveda), poulticing (Upanahaj and medicinal plasters ( Lepa), possessed of the efficacy of subdu-ing the deranged Vdyu, should be likewise resorted to. A\nsuppurated swelling should be opened and the pus drained.",
