        "text": "Treatment of lYIedoja Granthi : ln a case of Medoja Granthi (originated from the vitiated condition of the bodily fat) a plaster of pasted sesamum, placed inside the folds of a piece of linen, should be applied to the seat of the affected part and fomen-tations with hot iron-rods should be frequently applied, inasmuch as application of heat (lit. — fire) is efiicacious in such cases.",
