        "text": "The Indra-vasti (Marma) is situated twelve fingers above (?.i?., in the thirteenth finger of)\nthe Parshni. The reading in the printed editions of the text is '\"fifcaj\", whereas Vrinda and Chakradatta read \"f%wlT\". Dallana's reading also evidently is \"fiTwd\"- \"WT ' would be quite redundant and as \"f%f \"\ngives a better meaning, we accept this reading. Now we come to the second stanza.",
