        "text": "Now we shall discourse on the medical treatment of the affections of the mouth (lYIukha-ROga). i. Treat mcnt Of Vataja Oshtha-kopa: —\nIn a case of inflammation of the lips (Oshtha-Kopa)\ndue to the action of the deranged Vayu, the affected part should be rubbed with (an ointment composed ofj the four kinds of lardacious (Sneha) substances mixed with wax.",
        "iast": "athāto mukharogacikitsitaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ"
