        "type": "verse",
        "number": "4",
        "sanskrit": "विदध्यादोष्ठकोपे तु साल्वणं चोपनाहने/ मस्तिष्के चैव नस्ये च तैलं वातहरं हितम्",
        "text": "The swollen and inflamed lips should be treated (Pratisarana) with a compound con- Vdgbhata reads \" vf ig- \" . e., wax, in place of iftg 'f; sisting of Trikatu, Sarjikd-ksluira, Yava-Kshdra and Vid-lavana ;black-salt) pounded together and made into a thin paste with the admixture of honey.",
        "iast": "vidadhyādoṣṭhakope tu sālvaṇaṃ copanāhane/ mastiṣke caiva nasye ca tailaṃ vātaharaṃ hitam"
