        "text": "A decoction of the Kshiri trees should be used as gurgles (Gandusha), and clarified butter cooked with the paste-compound of Sdrivd, Utpitla, Yashti-madhu.\n5z; rrt (Lodhra Aguru, (red) Chandana and ten times its own weight of milk should be recommended as an errhine. 1 1-12.",
