        "text": "Gurgles 'Kavala) with milk, sugarcane juice, cow's urine, curd-cream, Kanjika, oil, or clarified butter (Sneha) should be prescribed according to the nature of the aggravated Doshas involved in each case (of the Sarva-sara-Mukha-roga), We have described above the medical treatment of the affections of mouth which yield to medical remedies. 43-45.\nincurable Types : — Now we shall enumerate the different incurable types of mouth-diseases.",
