        "number": "78",
        "sanskrit": "अवष्टम्भकरं चापि भयघ्नं दण्डधारणम्/ आस्या वर्णकफस्थौल्यसौकुमार्यकरी सुखा",
        "text": "Men should never deride a king, nor use harsh and impolite words to, nor act meanly and treacherously towards him.",
