        "text": "Climbing up trees, mountains, ant-hills and undula-ting grounds, etc., and going up to a waterfall as well as riding on a wild and unbroken horse or elephant aie strictly prohibited. One should not descend into an unknown tank, den as well as into the sea or into a river at flood times.",
        "iast": "yattu caṅkramaṇaṃ nātidehapīḍākaraṃ bhavet/ tadāyurbalamedhāgnipradamindriyabodhanam"
