        "text": "It is improper to lie down with one's head downward. One should not drink water from a broken vessel nor with the help of blended palms. Food, which is wholesome and approved of by one's physician and which abounds in articles of sweet and emollient pro-perties-f-should be taken at the proper (and regular)\ntime (every day) in a moderate quantity.",
