        "sanskrit": "न भुञ्जीतोद्धृतस्नेहं नष्टं पर्युषितं पयः/ न नक्तं दधि भुञ्जीत न चाप्यघृतशर्करम्",
        "text": "Curd should never be taken at night, nor should it be taken (at all) without sugar or clarified butter, nor without saturating it with Miidga-soup or the admixture of honey, nor without (the expressed juice of) the A'nialaka, nor with any hot substance or article, as otherwise it may bring on Kushtha (cutaneous affections), erysipelas, etc. 76- 7 .",
