        "type": "verse",
        "number": "6",
        "sanskrit": "गुर्वाभरणसंयोगात्ताडनाद्घर्षणादपि/ शोफः पाल्यां भवेच्छ्यावो दाहपाकरुगन्वितः",
        "text": "The disease is called the UilQiantlia, and is Madhava in his compilation reiis \" fg m\" (that the swelling is attended with a numbness and no pain) in place of \"cT <M?<j\"f f.\"\nVdgbhata also supports this, — Ed.\n504 THE SUSHRUTA SAMEIITA. pChap XXV.\noriginated through the concerted aciion of the deranged Vayu and the KapVia. 6.",
        "iast": "gurvābharaṇasaṃyogāttāḍanādgharṣaṇādapi/ śophaḥ pālyāṃ bhavecchyāvo dāhapākaruganvitaḥ"
