        "sanskrit": "बलं परं संभवतीन्दिर्याणां भवेच्च वक्त्रं वलिभिर्विमुक्तम्/ नाकामिने+अनार्थिनि नाकृताय नैवारये तैलमिदं प्रदेयम्",
        "text": "Treatment of Vyanga, etc. x—Ldkskd, Rodhra, the two kinds of Haridrd, Manah s'ild Haritdla, KusJitJia, Ndga (lead), Gairika, Varnaka ManjisJithd, VacJia, SaiirdsJitra-mrittikd , Pattanga Gorochand, Rasdnjana, bark of Hcmdnga iChampaka), the tender leaves of Vata, Kdliya-Kdshtha, Padma-kdshtha, the filaments of a lotus, both red and white cha?2dana, Mercury \" and the drugs of the Kdkolyddi group should be pasted together with milk.",
