        "text": "Measures for prolonging life— lYI. T. : — Now we shall discourse on life-prolonging measures and remedies. The powders of Vilva (roots) should be consecrated a thousand times with I ilva flowers by reciting the SreeSukta (as mentioned in the Rig-Veda), They should then be mixed with (powdered) gold, honey and clarified butter (in the form of an electuary), and licked every morning.",
