        "text": "The plant is there represented as a god, and his worship must at one time have attaired a remarkable popularity. The extraordinary properties of the exhihraling juice of the Soma are frequently mentioned in the Rig-veda and the language throughout in which it is behymned could not be more eulogistic. As an instance of Their virtues and methods of using them are identical with each other and are described below. 3 4.\nlYIode of using the Soma :— A room or an inner chamber ( Agara) in a commendable site protected with three walls on each side and provided with all kinds of accessories and attendants, should be first secured before taking (the expressed juice of) any of the aforesaid Soma plants.",
