        "text": "The patient (with the auspicious rites of protection, this we might refer to Rig-veda VIII. 48.3 which has been metrically translated by Muir as follows : —\nWe've quaffed the Soma bright, And are immortal grown ; We've entered into light, And all the gods have known. What mortal now can harm, Or foeman vex us more ?",
