        "text": "After that he should wash his mouth with warm water and quietly stroll about with his shoes on, 18, lYIetricai Texts :— The use of a potion of a (medicated) Ghrita is recommended to patients suffering from an extremely parched or dry condi-tion of the organism, or from ulcers, or from the effects of a poison, or from those due to the actions of the deranged Vaiya and Pitta, as well as to persons of weak memory and intellect.",
        "iast": "snehanīyā ca sā mātrā bahudoṣe ca pūjitā/ yā mātrā parijīryettu tathā pariṇate+ahani"
