        "text": "Clarified butter, without any other thing added thereto, should be administered in the affections of the deranged Pitta ; whereas it should be mixed with salt before use in the diseases due to the action of the deranged Vayu and with the admixture of Yava-kshdra and powdered Trikatu in the affections of the aggra-vated and deranged Kapha.",
