        "text": "A condition of dryness in the organism should be remedied with a Sneha, while an excess of the latter should be corrected with meals of S'ydmdka or Kora-dusha grains, as well as with milk-curd (Takra), levi-gated sesamum paste (Pinydka) and powdered barley (S'aktu). 20-23.",
