        "text": "Metrical Texts ;— Emetic and purgative remedies, in spite of their possessing in common the powers of motion (Saratva subtlety, keenness, ex-pansiveness and heat-making properties, tend to remove the injurious and deranged morbific principles (Doshas) of the body in (two) different ways by virtue of their respective inherent qualities (Prakriti) .",
