        "text": "Thus we have finished describing the diseases (Vyapat and -ymptoms which result from the injudi-cious use of Sneha (-Vastis) together wih the nature of the medical treatment to be employed in each of them. 2)7\nU ttara-vastis ; — Now we shall describe the mode of applying an Uttara-vasti (injection into the urethra of a male or of a female patient.",
