        "text": "Another alternative is to use a stick ( Varti) made up of the pendant soot of a room (Agara-dhuma Vrihati, Pippali, Madanaixxskt, Sain-dhava salt and S untJii pasted with S'ukta (a sort of Kanjika) and cow's urine (in the preceding manner).",
