        "sanskrit": "आगारधूमबृहतीपिप्पलीफलसैन्धवैः/ कृता वा शुक्तगोमूत्रसुरापिष्टैः सनागरैः",
        "text": "Diseases such as derangements of the semen, or of ovum, or difficult menstruation, excess or suppression The S'odhana drugs here are the Trina-pancha-mula and such other drugs. — Dallana.\nt According to Dallana a quantity of sugar and honey should be added in each of the three cases, viz., (i) the decoction of Yashti-madhu, (2) that of the Kshiri-trees, and (3) milk.\n626 THE SUSIIRUTA SAMHITA. tChap.",
