        "sanskrit": "अथातो निरूहक्रमचिकित्सितं व्याख्यास्यामः",
        "text": "CH.PTER XXXVIII. Now. we shall discourse on the mode of applying as well as on the treatment with a Nirudha-vastr (Nlrudhopakrama-Chikitsitam). i. The mode of preparing a Vasts ;— The application of an Anuvasana-vasti (enema) should be followed by that of one of the Asthapana class. The body of the patient should be first anointed (with a Sneha) and fomented.",
        "iast": "athāto nirūhakramacikitsitaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ"
