        "text": "The diges-tion of the ingested food taken by the patient is necessary (before the application of the Vasti). The physician having placed the pipe of the enema (Vasti)\nupon his left foot should firmly press its Karnika with the first and the second toes of his right foot.",
        "iast": "bastiṃ savye kare kṛtvā dakṣiṇenāvapīḍayet/ ekenaivāvapīḍena na drutaṃ na vilambitam"
