        "text": "The patient should be asked to take the same with care. 2. Metrical Text :— The physician should then hold the enema (Vasti) with his left hand and press its bladder with his right. The injection (of the medi-cinal solution contained in the enema) should be made at once, neither too slowly nor too hurriedly, 3.",
