        "text": "A long continuance in a sitting posture or bathing may give rise to pain in the region of the pelvis ; while, on the contrary, excess-ive walking under the circumstances aggravates the Vayu and is attended with pain in the knee-joints, atro-phy of the thighs, edematous swellings of the localities, or the form of disease known as Pada-harsha (sensitive-ness in the feet). 1 5-D.",
