        "text": "Now we shall discourse on the treatment which consists in employing the (inhalation of) medicated fumes, snuflfs errhines't and garcles (Dhuma-Nasya-Kavala-Graha-Chikitsita). i. Dhuma (fumes) may be divided into five groups\nz ., Prayogika (capable of being daily used), Snehana (soothing), Vairechana (expectoranti.t Kasaghna (anti-cough) and Vamaniya (emetic).",
