        "text": "The medicinal stick (Varti) should be lubricated See Chapter XXXV, Para. 7, Chikitsita Slhana.\nt Charaka's description of the pipes, (Chapter V, S'lokasthana) cor-responds closely to that of Sus'ruta, except in the case of Priyogika pipe, where Charaka's reading is somewhat ambiguous. There it may be construed to mean thirty-six as well as forty-eight fingers.",
