        "text": "In a case of an overwhelming aggravation of the Vayu, the patient may be made to use the snuff (of clarified butter) even twice a day. 29. Avapida-Nasya :— The Avapida-Nasya, like the Siro-Virechana Nasya, should be administered to a person bitten by a snake, or lying in a comatose or unconscious stat or suffering from a disease of the head due to its being oppressed with an accumulation of fat and mucus (Abhisyanda).",
