        "text": "Metrical Texts : — The evils which are usually found to attend an abuse of medicinal snuffs (Nasya)\nor errhines (S'iro-vireka) may be grouped into two classes — those incidental to the aggravation (Utkles'a) of the Doshas or to the loss or waste (Kshaya) of the same.",
