        "text": "Specific use of Sneha-Nasya :— This snuff should consist of oil in a case marked by (the con-certed actions of the deranged) Kapha and Vdyu, while it should consist of Vassi (lard) in a case involving the action of the VAyu alone. Similarly clarified butter should be used as a snuff in a case of a Fittaja disorder, while the snuff should consist of Majja (marrow) in a case marked by (the concerted actions of the deranged)\nVdyu and Pitta.",
