        "sanskrit": "यथोवाच भगवान् धन्वन्तरिः",
        "text": "The scat of the bite by a Mandali snake should not; however, be cauterized inasmuch as the preponderant Pittaja character of the poison, aggravated by the appli-cation of the heat, might lead to its speedy expansion or coursing in the system.",
        "iast": "yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ"
